---
alt: "Santashop admin app workflow"
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: Santashop admin app workflow
    accDescr: Major operator flows through staff sign-in, dashboard, search, scan and review check-in, preregistration, on-site registration, resend email, and stats

    SignIn[Admin sign-in page] --> Auth[Firebase Auth login]
    Auth --> Guard{Admin custom claim?}
    Guard -->|Yes| AdminShell[Admin shell / landing]
    Guard -->|No| Denied[Route blocked]

    Flags[(parameters/public)] --> LandingFlags[Feature flags]
    LandingFlags --> AdminShell

    AdminShell --> SearchHub[Search hub]
    SearchHub --> ByName[Search by name]
    SearchHub --> ByEmail[Search by email]
    SearchHub --> ByCode[Search by code]
    ByName --> SearchIndex[(registrationsearchindex/{uid})]
    ByEmail --> SearchIndex
    ByCode --> SearchIndex
    SearchIndex --> Results[Search results page]
    Results --> Review

    AdminShell --> Scan[Scan page]
    Scan --> LookupQR[Lookup registration by QR code]
    LookupQR --> SearchIndex
    LookupQR --> Registrations[(registrations/{uid})]
    Registrations --> Context[CheckInContextService]
    Context --> Review[Review page]

    Review -->|No edits| CheckInFn[checkIn callable]
    Review -->|Edited children| CheckInEditFn[checkInWithEdit callable]
    Review --> ChangeSlot[changeRegistrationDateTime callable]
    Review --> CancelReg[undoRegistration callable]

    CheckInFn --> Checkins[(checkins/{uid})]
    CheckInEditFn --> Checkins
    CheckInEditFn --> Edited[(editedregistrations/{uid})]
    CancelReg --> Registrations
    CancelReg --> SearchIndex
    ChangeSlot --> Registrations
    ChangeSlot --> EmailQueue[(tmp_registrationemails/{uid})]

    Checkins --> Confirm[Check-in confirmation page]
    Checkins --> Duplicate[Duplicate check-in page]

    AdminShell --> PreReg[Admin pre-registration page]
    PreReg --> Users[(users/{uid})]
    PreReg --> PreRegFn[callableAdminPreRegister]
    PreRegFn --> AuthUser[Create Firebase Auth user]
    PreRegFn --> Users
    PreRegFn --> Registrations
    PreRegFn --> SearchIndex
    PreRegFn --> EmailQueue

    AdminShell --> Onsite[On-site registration page]
    Onsite --> OnsiteFn[onSiteRegistration callable]
    OnsiteFn --> OnsiteRegs[(onsiteregistrations/{id})]
    OnsiteFn --> Checkins
    OnsiteFn --> Confirm

    AdminShell --> Resend[Resend email tool]
    Resend --> SearchIndex
    Resend --> ResendFn[callableResendRegistrationEmail]
    ResendFn --> EmailQueue
    ResendFn --> Registrations

    AdminShell --> RegStats[Registration stats page]
    AdminShell --> CheckinStats[Check-in stats page]
    AdminShell --> UserStats[User stats page]
    RegStats --> Stats[(stats/* docs)]
    RegStats --> Slots[(dateTimeSlots/{id})]
    CheckinStats --> Stats
    UserStats --> Stats
